Package: modnostics
Type: Package
Title: Evaluation of Model Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kay von Grünigen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Kay von Grünigen <kay.vongruenigen@gmail.com>
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Kay", "von Grünigen",
      email = "kay.vongruenigen@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny dashboard for reviewing
    diagnostics from linear mixed-effects models fit with lme4.
    The package combines model summaries, residual diagnostics,
    influence checks, and effect visualizations in one place to
    support a more consistent diagnostic workflow.
